  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Viego's Sovereign's Domination as in League. When an enemy champion he damaged dies, its soul waits by the body; near it he possesses it - on game 0.6.3 his whole body becomes that champion - and fights with its class's moves (fighter, marksman, mage, support or assassin). The data pack sees deaths only roughly and keeps Viego's own look; this add-on reads every takedown and draws the possessed body. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-11",
